{"id":"f343038d47627223","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy.md","title":"固定句法层级的部分真理与全真理不可定义","display":"prop-expressive-power-hierarchy — 固定句法层级的部分真理与全真理不可定义","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy","aliases":["91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy","91-prop-expressive-hierarchy"],"display":"prop-expressive-power-hierarchy — 固定句法层级的部分真理与全真理不可定义","depends_on":["[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy</span><span>91-prop-expressive-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-expressive-power-hierarchy — 固定句法层级的部分真理与全真理不可定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84940566355062f6\" href=\"?note=84940566355062f6\" title=\"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\)</span> 是固定前束句法类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\Sigma_n}=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\Sigma_n}=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 为标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> 可证性公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是全部基础真句编码集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 为一元公式类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}power\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\Sigma_1^0,\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\tau_n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau_n,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\Sigma_n}),\n\\qquad\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}power\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\Sigma_1^0,\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\tau_n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau_n,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\Sigma_n}),\n\\qquad\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>部分真理按有界矩阵及每个固定数量的量词块递归给出。关键是每个标准 n 可有不同 τ_n；并没有一个算术公式在所有 n 上统一定义全部真理。\n当前断言用句法层级，并把代码集与其定义公式签名展开；它不把 PA 等价闭包的成员测试误说成 PR 句法判定。加入 T 只是语言扩张，正确外延和证明论强度还需另论。</p>\n<p>来源：§5–§6 的部分真理；Theorem 7.5 的有限复杂度真理替换；Tarski 对角定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"84940566355062f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\Sigma_n}=\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^{\\mathrm{syn}}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}expressive\\text{-}power\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\Sigma_1^0,\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\tau_n\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau_n,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\Sigma_n}),\n\\qquad\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}).","display":true}],"bytes":1986,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-expressive-power-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["84940566355062f6","c289f1c721012496"]}